{
  "uid": "cf-loadtest-server",
  "title": "운영서버 상태",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 9,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "환경",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "dev,staging,prod",
        "current": {
          "text": "prod",
          "value": "prod"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "dev",
            "value": "dev",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "staging",
            "value": "staging",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "prod",
            "value": "prod",
            "selected": true
          }
        ],
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false
      },
      {
        "name": "host",
        "label": "서버",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "career-dev-staging,career-prod,career-monitor",
        "current": {
          "text": "career-prod",
          "value": "career-prod"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "career-dev-staging",
            "value": "career-dev-staging",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "career-prod",
            "value": "career-prod",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "career-monitor",
            "value": "career-monitor",
            "selected": false
          }
        ],
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "지표 읽는 순서",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**① API 성능** - RPS가 늘 때 P95-P99와 오류율도 함께 오르는지 확인\n\n**② 서버 자원** - 같은 시간의 CPU-메모리로 자원 부족 여부 확인\n\n**③ JVM-외부 호출** - Heap-GC와 외부 호출 지연을 비교해 원인 좁히기.\n\n시간대가 겹친다는 것만으로 원인이 확정되지는 않습니다."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "API 성능 · 처리량과 응답 품질",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "API 완료 처리량 · 전체 / 성공 (RPS)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"$env\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} 전체 완료"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "(sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"$env\",status=~\"2..\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or on (uri) (0 * sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"$env\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} 성공 (2xx)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byFrameRefID",
              "options": "A"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byFrameRefID",
              "options": "B"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      },
      "description": "전체: 모든 HTTP 상태의 완료 응답. 성공: HTTP 2xx 완료 응답. API 경로별 집계이며 actuator는 제외합니다. 요청을 보내는 목표 RPS와 다릅니다. HTTP 2xx가 업무상 성공을 항상 보장하지는 않습니다."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "API P50 · P95 · P99 응답 시간",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le,uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} P50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le,uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} P95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le,uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} P99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "API 5xx 비율",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"$env\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\",status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"$env\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} {{instance}} {{provider}} {{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "API 평균 응답 시간",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{env=\"$env\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"$env\",uri!~\"/actuator(/.*)?\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} {{instance}} {{provider}} {{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 201,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "서버 자원 · CPU, 메모리, 디스크",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "CPU 사용률",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - avg by (instance) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"host\",instance=\"$host\",mode=\"idle\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "orange"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "메모리 사용률",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"host\",instance=\"$host\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{job=\"host\",instance=\"$host\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "루트 디스크 사용률",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (1 - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"host\",instance=\"$host\",mountpoint=\"/\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{job=\"host\",instance=\"$host\",mountpoint=\"/\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "purple"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 202,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "JVM · 외부 호출",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "JVM heap",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{env=\"$env\",area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "GC 소요 시간",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(jvm_gc_pause_seconds_sum{env=\"$env\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "yellow"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "외부 호출 평균 시간",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (provider,operation) (rate(career_form_external_call_seconds_sum{env=\"$env\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (provider,operation) (rate(career_form_external_call_seconds_count{env=\"$env\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} · {{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "데이터 없음",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    }
  ],
